{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "restaurant-selforde-api",
		"name": "Restaurant Self-Order API",
		"description": "API тесты для системы самообслуживания ресторана",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
		"item": [
				{
					"name": "Device Management",
					"description": "1. Зарегистрируйте устройство через Register Device.\n2. Назначьте short_id через Assign Device Short ID (Admin).\n3. Получите информацию об устройстве.\n4. Обновите статус устройства с device_token.\n\nРекомендуемая последовательность:\n- Register Device → Assign Device Short ID → Get Device Info → Update Device Status.",
				"item": [
					{
						"name": "Register Device",
						"request": {
							"method": "POST",
							"header": [
								{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
							],
							"body": {
								"mode": "raw",
								"raw": "{\n  \"android_id\": \"test_android_id\",\n  \"model\": \"Lenovo Tab\",\n  \"os_version\": \"13.0\",\n  \"app_version\": \"1.0.0\"\n}"
							},
							"url": {
								"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/devices/register",
								"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
								"path": ["api", "devices", "register"]
							}
						},
						"response": []
					},
					{
						"name": "Get Device Info",
						"request": {
							"method": "GET",
							"header": [],
							"url": {
								"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{android_id}}",
								"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
								"path": ["api", "devices", "{{android_id}}"]
							}
						},
						"response": []
					},
					{
						"name": "Update Device Status",
						"request": {
							"method": "POST",
							"header": [
								{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
								{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{device_token}}" }
							],
							"body": {
								"mode": "raw",
								"raw": "{\n  \"battery\": 85,\n  \"last_activity\": \"2025-10-03T12:00:00Z\"\n}"
							},
							"url": {
								"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{android_id}}/status",
								"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
								"path": ["api", "devices", "{{android_id}}", "status"]
							}
						},
						"response": []
					},
					{
						"name": "Assign Device Short ID (Admin)",
						"request": {
							"method": "POST",
							"header": [
								{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
							],
							"body": {
								"mode": "raw",
								"raw": "{\n  \"android_id\": \"test_android_id\",\n  \"short_id\": \"1\"\n}"
							},
							"url": {
								"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/assign-device",
								"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
								"path": ["api", "admin", "assign-device"]
							}
						},
						"response": []
					}
				]
			},
				{
					"name": "Tablet Orders",
					"description": "1. Убедитесь, что устройство зарегистрировано и short_id назначен.\n2. Получите device_token при регистрации.\n3. Создайте заказ, передав device_token в Authorization.\n\nРекомендуемая последовательность:\n- Device Management → Tablet Orders → Create Order (device_token).",
				"item": [
					{
						"name": "Create Order (device_token)",
						"request": {
							"method": "POST",
							"header": [
								{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
								{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{device_token}}" }
							],
							"body": {
								"mode": "raw",
								"raw": "{\n  \"device_android_id\": \"test_android_id\",\n  \"table_short_id\": \"1\",\n  \"items\": [{\"menu_item_id\": \"menu_test_1\", \"qty\": 2}],\n  \"total\": 500\n}"
							},
							"url": {
								"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
								"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
								"path": ["api", "orders"]
							}
						},
						"response": []
					}
				]
			},
